title: "[Activity] ThrowPattern.Rewrite - Fixed of Manual" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
vars: {
  d2-legend: {
    f: Fixed {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"}
    m: Manual {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"}
  }
}
classes: {
  m: {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
  f: {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
  q: {shape: diamond}
}
start: "" {shape: circle; width: 20; style: {fill: black; stroke: "#9ca3af"}}
q0: "Buiten een AssertionScope?" {class: q}
m0: "Manual: Inside an AssertionScope\n(proof: ThrowExactly/assertion-scope, Invoking/assertion-scope)" {class: m}
q2: "Precies één typeargument?" {class: q}
m2: "Manual: Throw without exactly one type argument\n(geen proof)" {class: m}
q3: "Vorm x.Should().Throw<T>()?" {class: q}
m3: "Manual: is not in the form x.Should().Throw<T>()\n(geen proof)" {class: m}
q4: "Node is .Which, of resultaat weggegooid?" {class: q}
m4: "Manual: The result of Throw<T>() is used\n(proof: chain, edge-inner-exception)" {class: m}
q5: "Invoking: TryGetAction lukt;\nanders niet met FluentAssertions gebouwd?" {class: q}
m5: "Manual: Invoking-receiver/lambda, of FA-subject\n(proof: Invoking/side-effect-receiver, value-type, method-group)" {class: m}
q6: "Action of Func naar referentietype?" {class: q}
m6: "Manual: not an Action or a Func returning a reference type\n(proof: value-func)" {class: m}
qa: "ThrowExactly, of geen AggregateException-risico\n(ThrowMessage.MayThrowAggregate)?" {class: q}
ma: "Manual: FluentAssertions unwraps AggregateException\n(proof: aggregate-wait, aggregate-method-group)" {class: m}
q7: "Geen named args op Throw; becauseArgs\nalleen bij constante because?" {class: q}
m7: "Manual: named arguments or becauseArgs\n(geen proof)" {class: m}
q8: "Volgt .WithMessage(...) direct?" {class: q}
f0: "Fixed: Should.Throw<T>(act[, because])\n[.ShouldBeOfType<T>() bij ThrowExactly]\n(proof: simple, because, because-args, func, lambda,\nvalue-used, aggregate-expected, aggregate-get-result)" {class: f}
w1: "Geen named args, één waarde op WithMessage?" {class: q}
mw1: "Manual: WithMessage(...) with named arguments or becauseArgs\n(geen proof)" {class: m}
w2: "Patroon is een constante string?" {class: q}
mw2: "Manual: pattern is not a string constant\n(proof: message-variable)" {class: m}
w3: "Alleen een * vooraan of achteraan?" {class: q}
mw3: "Manual: wildcards other than a leading or trailing *\n(proof: message-wildcard)" {class: m}
w4: "Geen regeleinde naast een *?" {class: q}
mw4: "Manual: pattern contains a line break\n(proof: message-contains-line-break)" {class: m}
sel: "Welk patroon?" {class: q}
f1: "Fixed: ...Message.ShouldContain(lit, Case.Insensitive)\n(proof: message-contains)" {class: f}
f2: "Fixed: ...Message.ShouldStartWith / ShouldEndWith(lit, Case.Insensitive)\n(proof: message-starts, message-ends)" {class: f}
f4: "Fixed: ...Message.ShouldBe(lit[, because], IgnoreCase[ | IgnoreLineEndings])\n(proof: message-exact, message-exact-because, message-because,\nmessage-because-args, message-line-break, edge-multiline-message, edge-which-message)" {class: f}
start -> q0
q0 -> m0: nee
q0 -> q2: ja
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> m3: nee
q3 -> q4: ja
q4 -> m4: nee
q4 -> q5: ja
q5 -> m5: nee
q5 -> q6: ja
q6 -> m6: nee
q6 -> qa: ja
qa -> ma: nee
qa -> q7: ja
q7 -> m7: nee
q7 -> q8: ja
q8 -> f0: nee
q8 -> w1: ja
w1 -> mw1: nee
w1 -> w2: ja
w2 -> mw2: nee
w2 -> w3: ja
w3 -> mw3: nee
w3 -> w4: ja
w4 -> mw4: nee
w4 -> sel: ja
sel -> f1: "*lit*"
sel -> f2: "lit* / *lit"
sel -> f4: "lit"
